      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "carryover_16",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "carryover_percentage",
            value: 40,
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "ai_aggression",
            value: 0.75,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_17",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("So the day of the contention came. Each caste elected an aspirant from their ranks to become the new dominant. Each aspirant chose carefully three intendants to aid them."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_18",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("All the skills to lead a flight were tested. Each aspirant was put through trials of endurance, trials of warfare, trials of the hunt. In the end, only the two aspirants of Vladnir remained to face one another in the Arena of Dominance, in the very heart of Morogor..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "loyal_19",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            units: "Gorlack,Karron",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "clock_20",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "turn_limit",
            value: 24,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "objectives",
        side: 1,
        victory: _("Hold more villages at the end of turn 24 Defeat Karron"),
        defeat: _("Fail to hold more villages at the end of turn 24 Defeat of Gorlack"),
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_1",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "siege_of_laurelmor.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
